, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}], "type": "RSLT", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 11, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"content": "engenn11le12ob06re7pdf01.pdf", "type": "pdf"}]}], "responses": [{"id": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "selected": 0, "correct": 1}], "id": 0}], "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " Describe your morning activities.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Take Away", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Writing", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Speaking", "type": "skill"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self-Assessment.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=strong>Adam</span>: Martina! I certainly didn't expect to bump into you here. <br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: Boris, it's so great to see you! <br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: Umm, I'm not Bo \u2026<br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: I have an embarrassing admission to make. After having received your business card, I went straight home and Googled you!<br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: Well that's very flattering, but I should tell you that my name is actu \u2026<br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: \u2026 and I've got to say, having read your profile, I really do think that the universe just wants us to be together. Even the name, Boris. That was my grandfather's name! It's because of the name, really, that I knew we were destined to meet again.<br>", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=strong>Boris</span>: Actually I am \u2026\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Adam</span>: Be cool, Adam. Don't ruin this for me.<br><span class=strong>Boris</span>: I am Adam?<br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: Hi Adam, nice to meet you.<br><span class=strong>Boris</span>: But I am not \u2026<br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: Haha, of course you're Adam. Stop messing around. He's a little bit discombobulated due to the long flight. <br><span class=strong>Boris</span>:  Okay, I am Adam and you are Boris? I just want to get it straight, you know, since apparently I'm befuddled because of a long one-hour flight.<br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: Now you've got it, Adam. Wow, you really are flustered today.<br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: Well, having cleared that up, let's talk about how we can arrange to bump into each other again, Boris. Maybe tonight, for drinks?<br><span class=strong>Boris</span>: I love drinks!<br/><span class=strong>Adam</span>: She's talking to me, Adam.", "id": 2, "time": "36000", "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img07.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=strong>Boris</span>: Oh, right. I guess I'm still not thinking straight, having just completed an epic 60-minute voyage. You know how it is.<br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: Umm, not really ...<br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: Anyway, drinks would be lovely.<br><span class=strong>Martina</span>: Wait, I just noticed. Why does your name tag say Adam, Boris?<br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: Oh, oops, look at that. I must have grabbed the wrong one, owing to all of the confusion in the reception area.\n<br>\n<span class=strong>Boris</span>: But there was no confusion at all in the reception \u2026<br><span class=strong>Adam</span>: We've got to run, see you tonight!<br>", "id": 3, "time": "79000", "image": "engenn11le12ob06re2img06.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le12ob06re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le12ob06re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}